      {
        "id": 215045,
        "name": "dprcooke",
        "username": "dprcooke",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/{size}/1961_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-12T19:18:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also, since nobody else mentioned it, did anyone else pick-up the strange sound around an hout and 15-18 minutes in? I think they were trying to edit Adam's voice to sound like the 'Brain-in-a-Jar' version of Hi-Brow, but the timing was possibly messed up…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I did catch that, and was curious about it.&nbsp; Maybe Trevor just decided to have some fun?</p>\n<p>Also, on the feathers-vs-no-feathers front:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5d445834889ef69627b0e42e6c4559ecfa4afc2d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/5d445834889ef69627b0e42e6c4559ecfa4afc2d\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5d445834889ef69627b0e42e6c4559ecfa4afc2d.png\" alt=\"\" data-base62-sha1=\"dj4PBhd3gAJTuGEDgtiIgZKRnxX\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"690\" height=\"218\" data-dominant-color=\"DBDBDB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\"></span><span class=\"informations\">740×234 34.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Source: <a href=\"https://xkcd.com/1104/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">XKCD</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
