        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/53a042/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-13T18:56:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"padcurtin\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/padcurtin/48/2034_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> padcurtin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ceres and Pluto have a lot in common. They both are the first of their kind discovered. They both were classified as planets for over fifty years. They both are dwarf planets now .</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What they are classified as doesn't change what they are in my heart.</p>",
