      {
        "id": 215049,
        "name": "Ehkrickor",
        "username": "Ehkrickor",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ehkrickor/{size}/2035_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-03-14T17:03:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>cnranger wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;padcurtin wrote:<br><blockquote>Ceres and Pluto have a lot in common. They both are the first of their kind discovered. They both were classified as planets for over fifty years. They both are dwarf planets now .&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nWhat they are classified as doesn't change what they are in my heart.\n</blockquote></div>\ncnranger understands ;_;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Pluto is part of my solar family</p>\n<p>Ohana means family, Family means no one gets left behind or forgotten.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I love how there is just a whole generation of people who take Pluto's reclassification Very personally</p>",
